   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "If I were you",
     "texto": [
      "**An deiner Stelle würde ich …** means \"if I were you, I …\": **An deiner Stelle würde ich zum Arzt gehen** (if I were you, I'd go to the doctor). With «Sie»: **An Ihrer Stelle**.",
      "Another formula is **Ich würde dir raten, …** (I'd advise you to…): **Ich würde dir raten, mehr zu schlafen** (I'd advise you to sleep more)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Better would be",
     "texto": [
      "**Es wäre besser, wenn …** (it would be better if…) and **Es wäre gut, …** (it would be good…). The verb in the «wenn» clause goes at the end.",
      "Watch out: **würde** is only used in front of an infinitive; with «haben» and «sein» it isn't needed: **Ich hätte gern …**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
